​​MEGA ULT:​​

When self activates [War Soul] and gains {{1000}} Fury, ULT upgrades to MEGA ULT.

​​[War Soul]​​: Activates [War Soul] each time self gains {{2000}} Fury (ignores Fury cap).

​​MEGA ULT:​​

Consumes [War Soul] and {{1000}} Fury to release MEGA ULT.

Deals {{280%}} DMG to all enemies;

MEGA ULT applies [Black Blood Erosion] equal to {{25%}} of damage dealt;

Increases own {{30%}} CRIT Rate and CRIT Strength, lasts {{2}} rounds;

Releases [Savage Pressure];

If Orion has [Bloodline Power], consumes {{1}} stack to release [Savage Pressure] {{2}} additional times and restores {{150}} Fury;

After releasing MEGA ULT, if Orion has fewer than {{20}} stacks of [Bloodline Power], gains {{2}} stacks and performs a follow-up skill attack (this attack cannot grant [Bloodline Power] stacks);

​​[Savage Pressure]​​: Reduces main target's {{10%}} ATK and DEF, lasts {{3}} rounds, can be stacked up to {{5}} times.

​​Passive skill gains additional effects:​​

Increases own {{10%}} Dodge Prevention Rate; if own attack is dodged, increases own {{5%}} Dodge Prevention Rate and restores {{100}} Fury (lasts entire battle, cannot be dispelled; triggers up to {{3}} times per battle);

After successfully dodging, gains {{1}} stack of [Bloodline Power] and restores {{5%}} of Max HP.

